{{~## How every generated header ends: the `extern "C"` close and the guard.

   A blank line ahead of each close, matching the one the head leaves after each open, so
   the file's last declaration is not up against the closes the way it would be against a
   brace. ##~}}
{{~ if extern_c }}
#ifdef __cplusplus
}
#endif
{{~ end ~}}

#endif /* {{ guard }} */
